Combine the equalities or inequalities in the displayed calculation. Establish `hs2 : bk.iS bk.E ^ (3 * s.N) * bk.iA (w : Ainf l) ^ (2 * s.N) * (l : bk.DA bk.ρ₀) ^ s.c₂ * bk.iA τ ^ s.N = (bk.iS bk.E * bk.iA τ) ^ s.N * ((l : bk.DA bk.ρ₀) ^ s.c₂ * (bk.iS bk.E * bk.iA (w : Ainf l)) ^ (2 * s.N))`. Expand and normalize the polynomial expressions, which then agree. Rewrite using `[hs1, hs2]`. Conclude with `h5.symm`.
